Vikram and Betal: The Hardworking Girl (Raw Story)

id: WBX_100146

King Vikram was carrying Betal through the forest once again.

Betal began his story.

“Once there was a girl who lived in a small village,” said Betal. “She worked very hard every day.”

While others rested, she helped her family and studied.

Some people laughed at her and said, “Why do you work so much?”

But she continued her efforts.

After some time, she became very knowledgeable and successful.

The same people who laughed at her began to praise her.

Betal then asked, “Vikram, what helped the girl succeed?”

Vikram replied, “Her hard work and dedication helped her succeed.”

As soon as Vikram spoke, Betal flew back to the tree.

💖 Moral:

Hard work leads to success.
